INPUT INSTRUCTIONS

  DATA:

  File is laac2_wide.dat;

  VARIABLE:

  NAMES =   subject task
  Y1_1    Y1_10   Y1_2    Y1_3    Y1_4    Y1_5    Y1_6
  Y1_7    Y1_8    Y1_9    Y10_1   Y10_10  Y10_2   Y10_3   Y10_4   Y10_5
  Y10_6   Y10_7   Y10_8   Y10_9   Y11_1   Y11_10  Y11_2   Y11_3   Y11_4
